.TH KERF 1 "2026-10-29" "KerfScript" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
kerf \- the KerfScript laser cutting language
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kerf render
.I file.kerf
.RB [ \-o
.IR out.svg ]
.RI [ options ]
.br
.B kerf params
.I file.kerf
.br
.B kerf check
.I file.kerf
.SH DESCRIPTION
KerfScript is a programming language for laser cutting. A program describes
parametric 2D parts with cut, score and engrave layers, kerf compensation and
joinery.
.B kerf
runs a program and exports SVG or DXF files, packed onto sheets.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B render
Run the program and write the output file.
.TP
.B params
Print the customizer parameters as JSON.
.TP
.B check
Run the program and print its parts, sheets and warnings.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-o ", " \-\-out " \fIfile\fR"
Output file ending in .svg, .dxf or .json. Defaults to
.IR file .svg.
.TP
.BI \-D " name" = value
Set a parameter. The value is KerfScript: 40, "Oak", true, [1,2].
.TP
.BR \-p ", " \-\-params " \fIfile\fR"
Read parameter values from a JSON file.
.TP
.BI \-\-font " file.ttf"
Supply a font for text(), named after the file. Repeat for more fonts.
Atkinson Hyperlegible is built in as
.BR Atkinson .
.TP
.BI \-\-kerf " mm"
Override kerf compensation for every part.
.TP
.BI \-\-sheet " W" x H
Sheet size for packing, in millimetres.
.TP
.BI \-\-gap " mm"
Space between packed parts.
.TP
.BI \-\-margin " mm"
Space between the parts and the sheet edge. Defaults to the gap.
.TP
.B \-\-no\-pack
Keep parts where the program placed them.
.TP
.B \-\-guides
Include guide layer geometry.
.TP
.B \-\-split
Write one file per sheet: out-1.svg, out-2.svg, ...
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show help.
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-version
Show the package and language versions.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 on success. 1 when the program has an error, which is printed with its
line and column.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
kerf render box.kerf \-D width=120 \-\-sheet 600x400 \-o box.svg
kerf render box.kerf \-o box.dxf \-\-split
kerf params box.kerf
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
https://kerfscript.mylasertools.com/docs/
